<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλγ-ύνω</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ]</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλγύνεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					4.416
				</span></i>
			 : fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῠνῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					332
				</span></i>
			, etc.: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλγῡνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					458
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, with fut.
			
				Med.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλγυνοῦμαι</span> (in pass. sense) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				230
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				622
			</span></i> : aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλγύνθην</span>, v.
			infr.—Rare exc. in Trag., <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				90
			</span></i> (paratrag.), <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, and later Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.82c
			</span></i> :— <i>pain, grieve, distress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					746
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>feel, suffer pain, be grieved</i> or
			<i>distressed</i> at a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					468
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοις</span> X.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					172
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1021
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιδοῦσά τ᾽ ἠλγύνθην κέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					247
				</span></i>
			.</div>
